2. **Efficiency:**
   - For 2×2 matrices: O(1) time complexity (constant operations)
   - Space complexity: O(1) (creates small temporary matrices)
   - The recursive determinant calculation becomes inefficient for larger matrices (n > 10) but is perfectly suited for 2×2 cases

